# Cloudflare Pages routing (read only by Cloudflare when it serves this
# directory; the guide build leaves it alone, and production — the separate
# skills-ef-guide repo — only ever receives the HTML artifact).
# The 200 rule asks for an in-place rewrite, but because the target is an
# .html asset, Cloudflare's pretty-URL normalization answers the bare URL with
# a 308 to /skills-ef-guide instead (observed live, #280). Browsers follow it
# invisibly, so the dev-environment bookmark still needs no filename in it.
/ /skills-ef-guide.html 200
